{
 "facts": [
  "On 12 August 2023, Deborah said she had made a meditation guide for her yoga retreat since Deborah and Jolene last spoke.",
  "Jolene said people are surprised when they see a tamed snake. A photo shared alongside her account of the park outing showed a lizard on the ground among leaves.",
  "On 26 August 2023, Jolene said that she and her partner had talked on Friday, 25 August 2023, about how their loved ones influenced them and what those loved ones’ values meant to them. Jolene described the conversation as emotional and said it made them feel closer and clarified what matters.",
  "Jolene and her partner planned to play The Walking Dead on January 28, 2023.",
  "Jolene recently read a story about someone who succeeded despite numerous challenges. Jolene said the story showed that anything is possible with belief and hard work.",
  "On 20 September 2023, Deborah said she had a great time at a music festival with her pals, enjoyed dancing and the music, and felt music brings people together and helps people express feelings. Music reminds Deborah of her mother’s soothing voice singing lullabies.",
  "Jolene is interested in exploring how green technology could make a difference in disadvantaged areas and finding ways to contribute.",
  "Deborah used to play video games with Deborah’s husband; they took turns, and Deborah felt gaming helped them bond and make memories. Deborah and her husband prefer detective games together.",
  "During the week before 4 February 2023, engineer Jolene reached a major milestone: Jolene planned, researched, designed, and built a sustainable water purifier for a rural community in need. Jolene said the project went well, was challenging, and was a rewarding accomplishment.",
  "Deborah enjoys gardening because it brings people together, lets her share her love of plants, and helps people care for the world.",
  "Jolene thanked Deborah for the music tips and said she would check them out.",
  "Travel was a great passion of Deborah’s late mother.",
  "Deborah encouraged Jolene to draw on sources of strength during hard times, stay in touch, and take care of herself. Jolene said Deborah's encouragement meant a lot and promised to stay in touch.",
  "On September 1, 2023, Deborah attended a community meetup where people shared stories; the meetup made Deborah feel connected to others and reflect on the importance of relationships.",
  "Jolene and her partner returned from a trip to Rio de Janeiro on August 29, 2023. They took yoga classes there, and Jolene appreciated learning about different kinds of yoga and their backgrounds. Jolene and her partner also visited cafes and went on excursions, including a visit to an old temple with impressive stairs.",
  "Jolene is interested in the book “Sapiens,” which Jolene described as a fascinating look at human history and the effects of technology on people.",
  "Jolene said that spending time with people who love their work inspired her to stay focused and pursue her goals; the experience showed her that dedication and effort can make anything possible.",
  "Jolene said she achieved more than she had imagined during her mini retreat, which boosted her confidence.",
  "Jolene said appreciating small things helps her remember that something positive can be held onto even during tough times.",
  "Deborah has a favorite spot by a lake, with trees in the water, where she ponders and lets things go. Soothing surroundings and nice views make the spot ideal for reflection and letting go.",
  "Jolene said that seeing the water purifier working and providing clean water to a rural community felt surreal and deeply satisfying, gave Jolene a sense of purpose, and reminded Jolene that engineering can improve people's lives.",
  "As of 25 February 2023, Jolene and Jolene’s partner had been together for three years, were not married, and were taking their relationship slowly. Jolene clarified that the ring on Jolene’s partner’s hand in a photo was decoration, not a wedding ring.",
  "Jolene has snakes. Although the snakes cannot talk or understand what Jolene is going through, spending time with them is valuable to Jolene and teaches Jolene to slow down and be in tune with herself.",
  "Jolene's career aspiration is to continue working in engineering and create sustainable solutions that positively affect communities in need. Jolene hopes to help make the world a better place through engineering work.",
  "Jolene said her late mother taught her to persevere and never give up, while her partner’s father taught her partner to stay determined. Jolene said these values encourage Jolene to pursue engineering and her partner to pursue creative endeavors.",
  "On February 1, 2023, Jolene said her engineering professor had assigned a large robotics project. Jolene initially felt both excited and nervous, but was enjoying designing and programming the robot, solving the project like a puzzle, and seeing the robot come together.",
  "Deborah finds peace in keeping her deceased mother's memory alive. Artwork brings back powerful emotions and reminds Deborah of people she has lost; art gives Deborah solace.",
  "Jolene said she learned to play video games on her own as a child.",
  "On 25 February 2023, Deborah said that Deborah meditates, does yoga, and teaches classes in the morning, and spends time with loved ones in the evenings.",
  "Jolene’s female snake once escaped. Jolene searched for hours and found the snake snuggled under the bed; the experience made Jolene feel love and gratitude and realize how important the snake was to her.",
  "Jolene said on 2 March 2023 that one of her favorite dishes is lasagna and that she had a lot going on with her studies and exams.",
  "Jolene said she had just returned from a trip with her partner, an awesome yoga retreat. During yoga, Jolene saw a sunrise light up the sky with bright colors and felt alive and grateful.",
  "On 22 February 2023, Jolene said she had been wanting to try yoga on the beach and would give it a go.",
  "Jolene said Susie helps Jolene cope during difficult times, and that pets and video games provide company and distraction. The conversation does not specify what kind of animal Susie is.",
  "On 22 March 2023, Deborah said she makes a daily schedule or to-do list and shared a photo of her notepad with that day's tasks.",
  "On February 9, 2023, Jolene shared a photo of sketches in her planner, showing a notebook, a pen, and a notebook page with notes.",
  "Deborah said that she and Anna had recently sat by the sea, watched the sunset, and talked about how they inspired each other. Deborah asked Jolene what thoughts a photo of a person walking on a beach with a surfboard brought to mind.",
  "The bench at the park near Deborah’s home is meaningful because Deborah and Deborah’s mother used to sit there and talk about dreams and life. Deborah remembers watching a beautiful sunset there with Deborah’s mother in silence; returning to the spot brings Deborah peace and gratitude for the time they spent together.",
  "Jolene proposed a volunteer program in which engineers teach STEM to underprivileged children.",
  "Deborah said a blossom tree near her home bloomed every spring and was magical to watch. Watching the tree felt like admiring nature’s artwork, filled Deborah with awe, and helped her appreciate life’s beauty and hope for growth during tough times."
 ],
